    "terrainName": "demo-city",
    "description": "What: On demo-city, three IFVs ('Escort 1'..'Escort 3', TKB 101 — a type with sensors: an APC 2001 has no TargetMemory, so it never feels a hit, CE-1056; each with the BasicVehicleSop) drive north up Avenue E (x 652) as a road convoy (ConvoyOrder, Mode Route, 8 m/s, 15 m gaps) from (652, 90) toward (652, 420). An 'IED' lies at (652, 200); the 'Trigger man' (Neutral, covert, TriggerIed) at (641, 170) fires it when a vehicle is within 10 m. Nothing faked. The user's rule: the convoy ACTS when attacked — the same vehicles, nothing re-created. Judge: (1) the lead runs PlatformConvoy; (2) the charge goes off only with the lead at it; (3) it hits the lead; (4) the hit lead reacts by its SOP (VehicleFightFromCover — nothing to fight, so it ends) and drives on under its order; (5) the whole column leaves the kill zone together (the tail 100 m past the charge), never split; (6) the lead arrives. Fail: the column parks in the kill zone, splits, or a vehicle is re-created. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh cv-ambush"
  },
